---
import DesignSystemLayout from '../../layouts/DesignSystemLayout.astro';

const sections = [
  { id: 'hero-media',       label: 'Hero media' },
  { id: 'footer-columns',   label: 'Footer columns' },
  { id: 'bento',            label: 'Bento grid' },
  { id: 'product-section',  label: 'Product section' },
  { id: 'credibility-item', label: 'Credibility item' },
  { id: 'step-card',        label: 'Step card' },
  { id: 'feature-card',     label: 'Feature card' },
  { id: 'metric-row',       label: 'Metric row' },
  { id: 'case-stat',        label: 'Case stat' },
  { id: 'case-quote',       label: 'Case quote card' },
  { id: 'curated-card',     label: 'Curated card' },
  { id: 'audience-tile',    label: 'Audience tile' },
  { id: 'partner-note',     label: 'Partner note' },
  { id: 'speaker',          label: 'Speaker block' },
  { id: 'plan-card',        label: 'Plan card' },
  { id: 'testimonial',      label: 'Testimonial' },
  { id: 'form-field',       label: 'Form field' },
  { id: 'mobile-link',      label: 'Mobile menu link' },
  { id: 'author-chip',      label: 'Author chip' },
  { id: 'author-stack',     label: 'Author stack' },
  { id: 'post-card',        label: 'Post card' },
  { id: 'tag-group',        label: 'Tag group' },
  { id: 'breadcrumb',       label: 'Breadcrumb' },
  { id: 'author-panel',     label: 'Author panel' },
];
---

<DesignSystemLayout
  title="Molecules"
  section="02 · Molecules"
  lede="Atoms combined into reusable building blocks. Bento grid, product section, step card, plan card, credibility item, metric row, testimonial, post card, author chip, tag group, form field, mobile menu link, case stat, case quote card, curated card, audience tile, partner note, hero media and footer columns."
  sections={sections}
>

  <!-- ─────────── HERO MEDIA ─────────── -->
  <section class="ds-section" id="hero-media">
    <div class="ds-section-head">
      <h2>Hero media</h2>
      <span class="ds-tag">.hero-media · .hero-img</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ds-note">
      The home page hero is a full-bleed landscape with the copy centred in its sky.
      <code class="ds-inline">.hero-media</code> is absolutely positioned at the top of the section
      and holds the artwork at its own aspect ratio (<code class="ds-inline">1536 / 1024</code>) across
      the full width, so the picture is never cropped and the section grows with it
      (<code class="ds-inline">min-height: 66.67vw</code>). There is no gradient, scrim or blur
      anywhere in the hero: the painting itself stops on a torn organic edge and gives way to flat
      white, which meets <code class="ds-inline">--warm-white</code> on the page. A replacement must
      carry that edge, keep a light sky across the top half for the copy to sit on, and have both
      ratios updated here and in <code class="ds-inline">global.css</code>. Replace
      <code class="ds-inline">/public/images/hero-landscape.webp</code>. Portrait viewports fall back
      to a bottom-anchored cover crop.
    </p>
    <div class="ds-specimen">
      <pre class="ds-code"><span class="tag">{`<section `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"hero"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span>
  <span class="tag">{`<div `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"hero-media"`}</span> <span class="attr">aria-hidden</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"true"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span>
    <span class="tag">{`<img `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"hero-img"`}</span> <span class="attr">src</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"/images/hero-landscape.webp"`}</span> <span class="attr">alt</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`""`}</span> <span class="attr">fetchpriority</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"high"`}</span><span class="tag">{` />`}</span>
  <span class="tag">{`</div>`}</span>
  <span class="tag">{`<div `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"hero-inner"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span> …eyebrow, h1, .hero-sub, .hero-btns… <span class="tag">{`</div>`}</span>
<span class="tag">{`</section>`}</span></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─────────── FOOTER COLUMNS ─────────── -->
  <section class="ds-section" id="footer-columns">
    <div class="ds-section-head">
      <h2>Footer columns</h2>
      <span class="ds-tag">.site-footer · .footer-cols · .footer-col · .footer-bottom · .footer-media</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ds-note">
      The shared footer is rendered by <code class="ds-inline">src/components/Footer.astro</code> and
      used by every layout. It is a single <code class="ds-inline">--warm-white</code> block: a hairline
      <code class="ds-inline">.footer-divider</code>, a four-column grid (brand column plus three
      <code class="ds-inline">.footer-col</code> link stacks), a tall gap, then
      <code class="ds-inline">.footer-bottom</code> with the copyright and legal links. A landscape in
      <code class="ds-inline">.footer-media</code> fills the whole block, cover-cropped from the
      bottom, with no CSS fade: the artwork itself carries a near-white sky in its upper half, and a
      soft dark vignette under the legal row keeps the white text legible.
      Replace <code class="ds-inline">/public/images/footer-landscape.webp</code> to change it.
    </p>
    <div class="ds-specimen">
      <div class="ds-specimen-preview is-block">
        <div class="footer-col">
          <div class="footer-col-title">Membership</div>
          <a href="#">How it works</a>
          <a href="#">What you get</a>
          <a href="#">Get access</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <pre class="ds-code"><span class="tag">{`<div `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"footer-col"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span>
  <span class="tag">{`<div `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"footer-col-title"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span>Membership<span class="tag">{`</div>`}</span>
  <span class="tag">{`<a `}</span><span class="attr">href</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"/#how"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span>How it works<span class="tag">{`</a>`}</span>
<span class="tag">{`</div>`}</span></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─────────── CREDIBILITY ITEM ─────────── -->
  <section class="ds-section" id="bento">
    <div class="ds-section-head">
      <h2>Bento grid</h2>
      <span class="ds-tag">.bento · .bento-cell · .is-surface · .is-half · .is-wide · .bento-card</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ds-note">
      Filled cells of unequal size on a six-column track. One
      <code class="ds-inline">.is-surface</code> cell spans four columns and two rows and carries a
      white <code class="ds-inline">.bento-card</code> as the product surface; the rest carry a
      line icon, a title and a sentence at <code class="ds-inline">.is-half</code> (two columns) or
      <code class="ds-inline">.is-wide</code> (four). Placement is automatic, so the order in the
      markup is the order on the page.
    </p>
    <p class="ds-note">
      This exists so that two adjacent sections do not read as the same section twice. The home page
      uses it for “what you get” and the <a href="#product-section">product section</a> for “how we
      choose”; do not use both patterns for the same kind of content.
    </p>
    <div class="ds-specimen">
      <div class="ds-specimen-preview is-block">
        <div class="bento">
          <div class="bento-cell is-surface">
            <div>
              <span class="bento-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M4 4v16h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                  <path d="M8 14l3-4 3 3 4-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
              <h3 class="bento-title">A dashboard for your body</h3>
              <p>The same rigor your advisor applies to your portfolio, applied to your biology.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bento-card">
              <div class="stack-card-head">Health score overview</div>
              <div class="metric">
                <span class="metric-name">Cardiovascular</span>
                <div class="metric-track"><div class="metric-fill is-good" style="width:82%"></div></div>
                <span class="metric-val">82</span>
              </div>
              <div class="metric">
                <span class="metric-name">Metabolic</span>
                <div class="metric-track"><div class="metric-fill is-warn" style="width:74%"></div></div>
                <span class="metric-val">74</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-cell is-half">
            <span class="bento-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 3v5a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M3.5 3h2M11 3h2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M9 16v1a4 4 0 0 0 8 0v-1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <circle cx="18" cy="13.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="bento-title">Curated clinical delivery</h3>
            <p>Physician-led care nationwide, virtual and in person.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-cell is-half">
            <span class="bento-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 3c0 4 10 5 10 9s-10 5-10 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M17 3c0 4-10 5-10 9s10 5 10 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M8.5 6.5h7M7 12h10M8.5 17.5h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="bento-title">Full biomarker tracking</h3>
            <p>Multiple comprehensive panels per year, DEXA, CGM cycles.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-cell is-half">
            <span class="bento-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="2.8" y="8.2" width="18.4" height="7.6" rx="3.8" transform="rotate(-45 12 12)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M9.3 9.3l5.4 5.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="bento-title">Personalized protocols</h3>
            <p>Calibrated to your biology, not a template.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bento-cell is-wide">
            <span class="bento-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 17h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M5 17a7 7 0 0 1 14 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M12 7V5M10.5 5h3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="bento-title">Health concierge</h3>
            <p>A dedicated coordinator who handles specialist referrals and appointment logistics.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-specimen-meta">
        <span><strong>.is-surface</strong> · 4 cols &times; 2 rows, holds the white card</span>
        <span><strong>.is-half</strong> / <strong>.is-wide</strong> · 2 and 4 cols</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─────────── PRODUCT SECTION ─────────── -->
  <section class="ds-section" id="product-section">
    <div class="ds-section-head">
      <h2>Product section</h2>
      <span class="ds-tag">.prod · .prod-list · .prod-item · .prod-timer · .prod-panel · .prod-pane</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ds-note">
      An interactive section. A <a href="/design-system/atoms#section-heads">section head</a>, then
      a two-column row: <code class="ds-inline">.prod-list</code> is a
      <code class="ds-inline">role="tablist"</code> of choices on the left, and choosing one swaps
      the <code class="ds-inline">.prod-pane</code> inside the soft
      <code class="ds-inline">.prod-panel</code> on the right and marks the matching row in the
      card behind it. The selected tab takes the panel fill, so the row and the card it drives read
      as one object. Pointer, arrow keys, Home and End all work; with no JavaScript the first pane
      stays open and every choice is still readable in the list.
    </p>
    <p class="ds-note">
      The tabs also advance on their own every seven seconds. The countdown bar under the active
      tab (<code class="ds-inline">.prod-timer</code>) is a CSS animation, and the advance is driven
      by its <code class="ds-inline">animationend</code>, so the bar and the switch can never drift
      apart. Hovering or focusing anywhere in the section pauses both at once; leaving the viewport
      pauses them; clicking a tab is taken as the reader taking over and stops the rotation for
      good. Under <code class="ds-inline">prefers-reduced-motion</code>, or with no JavaScript,
      nothing rotates and the bar never appears.
    </p>
    <p class="ds-note">
      Tabs are real <code class="ds-inline">&lt;button&gt;</code> elements, so their body copy is a
      <code class="ds-inline">.prod-copy</code> span rather than a
      <code class="ds-inline">&lt;p&gt;</code>: flow content is not valid inside a button.
    </p>
    <p class="ds-note">
      <strong>Each pane is a different figure, never the same list with different words.</strong>
      The three on the home page are a roster (<code class="ds-inline">.team-row</code>, with a
      dashed footer and a pulse for continuity), a coverage map
      (<code class="ds-inline">.cov-figure</code> headline number over a
      <code class="ds-inline">.cov-grid</code> of tiles) and a gated flow
      (<code class="ds-inline">.gate-chips</code> above a connected
      <code class="ds-inline">.gate-flow</code>). If a new pane would repeat a shape that is
      already in the section, it needs a different figure, not different labels. The panel is
      top-aligned rather than centred so the card does not jump as the heights change.
    </p>
    <p class="ds-note">
      <strong>Every label inside a panel is lifted verbatim from copy that already appears in that
      section.</strong> A panel illustrates the copy; it never introduces new copy. The card behind
      (<code class="ds-inline">.stack-back</code>) is offset and clipped by the panel so the stack
      reads as depth, and it is <code class="ds-inline">aria-hidden</code> because it is decoration.
    </p>
    <div class="ds-specimen">
      <div class="ds-specimen-preview is-block">
        <div class="prod-grid">
          <div class="prod-list is-auto" role="tablist" aria-label="Example">
            <button class="prod-item" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">
              <span class="prod-item-head">
                <span class="prod-icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M5 3v5a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <path d="M3.5 3h2M11 3h2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <path d="M9 16v1a4 4 0 0 0 8 0v-1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    <circle cx="18" cy="13.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="prod-title">Clinical care</span>
              </span>
              <span class="prod-copy">Physician-led teams with published outcomes and continuous care between visits.</span>
              <span class="prod-timer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="prod-timer-fill"></span></span>
            </button>
            <button class="prod-item" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">
              <span class="prod-item-head">
                <span class="prod-icon">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                    <path d="M4 8V5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.5 4H8M16 4h2.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 20 5.5V8M20 16v2.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5H16M8 20H5.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4 18.5V16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span class="prod-title">Diagnostics and screening</span>
              </span>
              <span class="prod-copy">Baseline testing, multi-cancer early detection and imaging.</span>
              <span class="prod-timer" aria-hidden="true"><span class="prod-timer-fill"></span></span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="prod-panel">
            <div class="prod-panes">
              <div class="prod-pane is-active" role="tabpanel">
                <div class="stack-card">
                  <div class="stack-card-head">Your clinical team</div>
                  <div class="team-row">
                    <span class="team-badge" aria-hidden="true">M</span>
                    <span class="team-role">MD-led</span>
                    <span class="team-note">Published outcomes</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="team-row">
                    <span class="team-badge" aria-hidden="true">C</span>
                    <span class="team-role">Health concierge</span>
                    <span class="team-note">Specialist referrals</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="team-foot">
                    <span class="team-pulse" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
                    Continuous care between visits
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stack-back" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="stack-row is-active"><span class="stack-mark"></span>Clinical care</div>
              <div class="stack-row"><span class="stack-mark"></span>Diagnostics and screening</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-specimen-meta">
        <span><strong>[aria-selected="true"]</strong> · takes the panel fill and shows the timer</span>
        <span><strong>.prod-timer</strong> · 7s countdown, drives the advance</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─────────── CREDIBILITY ITEM ─────────── -->
  <section class="ds-section" id="credibility-item">
    <div class="ds-section-head">
      <h2>Credibility item</h2>
      <span class="ds-tag">.credbar · .cred-item</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ds-note">Used in the home page credibility bar. Sage Lato number above a neutral caption. Each item carries its own left hairline, so the strip can wrap to any number of rows without leaving an orphan separator; the <code class="ds-inline">.cred-divider</code> elements still in the markup are no longer drawn.</p>
    <div class="ds-specimen">
      <div class="ds-specimen-preview">
        <div class="cred-item">
          <span class="cred-num">400</span>
          <span class="cred-text">UHNW clients reached in our first delivery</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-divider"></div>
        <div class="cred-item">
          <span class="cred-num">May 2026</span>
          <span class="cred-text">Live with one of the largest global private banks</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <pre class="ds-code"><span class="tag">{`<div `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"cred-item"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span>
  <span class="tag">{`<span `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"cred-num"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span>400<span class="tag">{`</span>`}</span>
  <span class="tag">{`<span `}</span><span class="attr">class</span><span class="tag">=</span><span class="str">{`"cred-text"`}</span><span class="tag">{`>`}</span>UHNW clients reached…<span class="tag">{`</span>`}</span>
<span class="tag">{`</div>`}</span></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─────────── STEP CARD ─────────── -->
  <section class="ds-section" id="step-card">
    <div class="ds-section-head">
      <h2>Step card</h2>
      <span class="ds-tag">.step</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ds-note">Three-up grid in the “how it works” section. Large Lato numeral, Lato title, body. Not boxed: a hairline on top of each cell draws the row rules, a hairline on the left of every cell that is not first in its row draws the columns, and the first column sits flush with the container so it lines up with the section title.</p>
    <div class="ds-specimen">
      <div class="ds-specimen-preview is-block">
        <div class="steps" style="margin-top:0;">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-n">01</div>
            <div class="step-title">Join through your advisor</div>
            <p>Access Compound Health as a benefit through your wealth advisor. No cold starts, no separate onboarding.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-n">02</div>
            <div class="step-title">Deep diagnostic intake</div>
            <p>A comprehensive baseline: advanced bloodwork, imaging, genetic risk, cognitive and metabolic assessments.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-n">03</div>
            <div class="step-title">Personalized longevity plan</div>
            <p>Your clinical team and a dedicated concierge build and actively manage a protocol tailored to your data.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─────────── FEATURE CARD ─────────── -->
  <section class="ds-section" id="feature-card">
    <div class="ds-section-head">
      <h2>Feature card</h2>
      <span class="ds-tag">.feat · .feat.span2</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ds-note">The hairline feature grid. The home page now uses <a href="#product-section">the product section</a> instead; <code class="ds-inline">.feat</code> remains in use on the advisor and deck pages, where <code class="ds-inline">.feat-grid-3</code> runs it three-up. Two-column grid with an optional double-width variant, separated by hairlines rather than boxed. Because <code class="ds-inline">.span2</code> breaks the column count, cells in the right-hand column are marked <code class="ds-inline">.is-col2</code> in the markup. Icons are single-weight, monochrome line SVGs (24&times;24, <code class="ds-inline">stroke="currentColor"</code>) set in <code class="ds-inline">.feat-icon</code>; never emoji.</p>
    <div class="ds-specimen">
      <div class="ds-specimen-preview is-block">
        <div class="feat-grid">
          <div class="feat">
            <div class="feat-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 3v5a4 4 0 0 0 8 0V3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M3.5 3h2M11 3h2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M9 16v1a4 4 0 0 0 8 0v-1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <circle cx="18" cy="13.5" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="feat-title">Elite clinical delivery</div>
            <p>Virtual care nationwide, with local provider coordination for in-person diagnostics.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feat is-col2">
            <div class="feat-icon">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 3c0 4 10 5 10 9s-10 5-10 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M17 3c0 4-10 5-10 9s10 5 10 9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M8.5 6.5h7M7 12h10M8.5 17.5h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="feat-title">Full biomarker tracking</div>
            <p>Multiple comprehensive panels per year, DEXA, performance battery, CGM and wearable data.</p>
          </div>
